# Input
```css
/* .plain and .foo\+bar match classes used in escaped_class.jsx.
   .unused\+name is also escaped, but nothing references it. */

.plain {
	color: red;
}

.foo\+bar {
	color: blue;
}

.unused\+name {
	color: green;
}

```

